---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Loch Fyne Musical Festival Glamping | The Cosy Canvas Co."
  description="Bell tent glamping for Loch Fyne Musical Festival. The Cosy Canvas Co. is coming back — canvas villages pitched for the weekend on the west coast."
>
  <div class="bg-[#111111] text-white py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-stone-800 relative z-30">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-[#F7BA1E] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 font-bold">THEY WANT US BACK</span>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white">Loch Fyne Musical Festival</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm md:text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Canvas on the shore of the festival. We pitched it once. They have asked us to come back.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-black text-[#111111] mb-4">A west-coast weekend under canvas</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Loch Fyne Musical Festival is the kind of ground bell tents were made for: music, a proper night’s sleep, and a village that does not look like a car-park of nylon.
      </p>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        We will pitch guest canvas for the weekend — same Cosy Canvas standard as our Rat Race and wedding villages: delivered, guyed, and collected so you can stay in the music.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/events"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#F7BA1E] text-[#111111] font-display font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3"
      >
        Enquire for Loch Fyne
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-6">
        Prefer a named package? See <a href="/events/rat-race" class="underline hover:text-[#7D6E23]">Rat Race Cosy and Deluxe 6M offerings</a> — those are bookable online.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
